            "description_html": "<b>NGP 613-48, 6 x 1/4 x 48 Saddle Threshold</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n6\" wide x 1/4\" high x 48\" length aluminum ADA compliant saddle threshold.  These 4 foot long thresholds are made from non rusting T5 aluminum alloy and used for filling the gap between the door bottom and floor. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMill finish Aluminum.  Packaged with #10 flat head zinc plated wood screws. Fluted top with typical wall thickness of .125\". \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available  <a href=\"/products/6-x-1-4-x-36-saddle-threshold-ngp-613-36\"><b>3 Foot  Saddle Threshold</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/6-x-1-4-x-72-saddle-threshold-ngp-613-72\"><b>6 Foot Saddle Threshold</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for NGP 613-48 48\" Saddle Threshold\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 48\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Wall Thickness: .125 (1/8\")</li>\r\n<li>Material: T5 aluminum alloy</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Mill Finish Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Installation Screws: #10 FH Zinc Plated Wood Screws</li>\r\n<li><b>ADA Compliant</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
